人の入浴料は300円。」を混同しません。「所在地は福井県丹生郡越前町大谷15-1。」で、男女大浴場のほか大広間・機能回復訓練室を備える湧水の施設として、個室利用を一人前提にせず入浴を組む計画です。","anchors":["老人憩いの家 陶寿園","業務時間は10:00〜17:00で、入浴のみは19:00まで。","休日は月曜日・木曜日と12月28日〜1月3日。","町外大人の入園料金は400円、町外大人の入浴料は300円。","所在地は福井県丹生郡越前町大谷15-1。","男女大浴場、和室・洋室の個室、大広間、機能回復訓練室、碁と将棋を備える。","カルシウム・マグネシウムなどのイオン分を含む湧水を浴場に取り入れ、保養・リハビリ・研修に利用される。"],"quality":"grounded","policyVersion":"official-provenance-v2"},"n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["town.echizen.fukui.jp"],"urls":["https://www.town.echizen.fukui.jp/shisetsu/09/p001497.html"]}]},"w708226699":{"checked":"2026-08-11","facts":[{"conflict":false,"k":"status","n":1,"official":false,"src":["naminohana-onsen.jp"],"urls":["https://naminohana-onsen.jp/"],"v":"open"},{"conflict":false,"k":"hours","n":1,"official":false,"src":["naminohana-onsen.jp"],"urls":["https://naminohana-onsen.jp/"],"v":"9:30-21:30"},{"conflict":false,"k":"closed_days","n":1,"official":false,"src":["naminohana-onsen.jp"],"urls":["https://naminohana-onsen.jp/"],"v":"第1・3・5火曜日（祝日の場合は翌日）"},{"conflict":false,"k":"price","n":1,"official":false,"src":["rurubu.jp"],"urls":["https://rurubu.jp/andmore/spot/80017218"],"v":640},{"conflict":false,"k":"luggage","n":1,"official":false,"src":["onsen.nifty.com"],"urls":["https://onsen.nifty.com/fukui-onsen/onsen002049/kuchikomi/"],"v":"locker"},{"conflict":false,"k":"city","n":1,"official":false,"src":["city.fukui.lg.jp"],"urls":["https://www.city.fukui.lg.jp/kankou/kankou/sisetu/p000890.html"],"v":"福井市"},{"conflict":false,"k":"bring_towel","n":1,"official":false,"src":["supersento.com"],"urls":["https://www.supersento.com/hokuriku/fukui/nami.html"],"v":"required"}]},"w714998142":{"checked":"2026-08-11","facts":[{"conflict":false,"k":"status","n":1,"official":false,"src":["city.fukui.lg.jp"],"urls":["https://www.city.fukui.lg.jp/fukusi/kfukusi/ikigai/p015195.html"],"v":"closed_permanently"},{"conflict":false,"k":"city","n":2,"official":false,"src":["city.fukui.lg.jp","yuru-to.net"],"urls":["https://www.city.fukui.lg